 ('ENT_GOE_BELETH','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 13th spirit, a terrible King riding a pale horse with trumpets sounding before him, 85 legions; procures the love of any man or woman.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_LERAJE','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 14th spirit, a Marquis in green clad as an archer, 30 legions; causes great battles and contests and makes arrow-wounds putrefy.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ELIGOS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 15th spirit, a Duke as a goodly knight with lance and serpent, 60 legions; discovers hidden things, knows things to come and of wars, procures the favour of lords and knights.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ZEPAR','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 16th spirit, a Duke in red apparel and armour, 26 legions; makes women love men and brings them together, and can make women barren.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BOTIS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 17th spirit, a President and Earl (viper then man with sword), 60 legions; tells things past and to come and reconciles friends and foes.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BATHIN','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 18th spirit, a Duke with serpent''s tail on a pale horse, 30 legions; knows the virtues of herbs and stones and transports men suddenly between countries.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SALLOS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 19th spirit, a peaceable Duke riding a crocodile with a ducal crown, 30 legions; causes men and women to love one another.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_PURSON','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 20th spirit, a great King riding a bear with a trumpet, 22 legions; tells things hidden, past, present and to come, discovers treasure, gives good familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_MARAX','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 21st spirit, an Earl and President as a bull with a man''s face, 30 legions; teaches astronomy and the liberal sciences and the virtues of herbs and stones, gives good familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_IPOS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 22nd spirit, an Earl and Prince (angel with lion''s head, goose''s feet, hare''s tail), 36 legions; knows things past and to come and makes men witty and bold.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_AIM','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 23rd spirit, a Duke with three heads bearing a firebrand, 26 legions; sets cities and great places ablaze, makes men witty, answers truly of private matters.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_NABERIUS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 24th spirit, a Marquis as a black crane, 19 legions; makes men cunning in all arts and sciences, especially rhetoric, and restores lost dignities and honours.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_GLASYA_LABOLAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 25th spirit, a President and Earl as a winged dog, 36 legions; teaches all sciences in an instant, is captain of manslaughter and bloodshed, causes love and grants invisibility.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BUNE','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 26th spirit, a Duke as a three-headed dragon, 30 legions; changes the place of the dead, makes men rich, wise and eloquent, gives true answers.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_RONOVE','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 27th spirit, a Marquis and Earl, 19 legions; teaches rhetoric and the knowledge of tongues, gives good servants and the favour of friends and foes.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BERITH','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 28th spirit, a Duke (Beal/Bolfry) as a red soldier on a red horse, 26 legions; gives true answers of past/present/future and turns metals to gold, but is a notorious liar. Also reckoned an officer of Hell''s court (Baalberith, keeper of the infernal archives) and derived from the Canaanite Baal-Berith (''lord of the covenant'').','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ASTAROTH','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 29th spirit, a mighty Duke as a foul angel on an infernal dragon, 40 legions; gives true answers of past/present/future, discovers all secrets, teaches the liberal sciences and discourses on the fall of the angels. Also a Grand Duke / Great Prince of Hell (Weyer, de Plancy). A demonized, re-gendered reception of the Canaanite goddess Astarte/Ashtoreth.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_FORNEUS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 30th spirit, a Marquis as a great sea-monster, 29 legions; teaches rhetoric and languages, gives men a good name, and causes them to be loved by friends and foes.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_FORAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 31st spirit, a President as a strong man, 29 legions; teaches the virtues of herbs and stones, logic and ethics, finds lost things and treasure, makes men invisible, witty and long-lived.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ASMODAY','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 32nd spirit, a great King with three heads on an infernal dragon, 72 legions; gives the ring of virtues, teaches arithmetic, astronomy, geometry and all handicrafts, and guards hidden treasure. The Goetic reception of Asmodeus (Book of Tobit), ultimately the Avestan Aeshma Daeva.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_GAAP','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 33rd spirit, a President and King under Amaymon of the south, 66 legions; teaches philosophy and the liberal sciences, causes love or hatred, carries men swiftly between kingdoms, delivers familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_FURFUR','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 34th spirit, an Earl as a winged hart, 26 legions; causes love between man and wife, raises tempests and lightning, and gives true answers of secret and divine things when within a triangle.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_MARCHOSIAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 35th spirit, a Marquis as a wolf with griffin''s wings and serpent''s tail, 30 legions; a strong fighter who gives true answers, hoping to return to the Seventh Throne.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_STOLAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 36th spirit, a Prince as a crowned night-raven/owl, 26 legions; teaches astronomy and the virtues of herbs and precious stones.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_PHENEX','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 37th spirit, a Marquis as a phoenix singing sweetly, 20 legions; an excellent poet who answers truly of the sciences, hoping to return to the Seventh Throne after 1,200 years.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_HALPHAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 38th spirit, an Earl as a stock-dove, 26 legions; builds towers full of weapons and ammunition and sends men of war to appointed places.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_MALPHAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 39th spirit, a President as a crow then a man, 40 legions; builds houses and towers, throws down enemies'' buildings, reveals their thoughts, gives good familiars, but deceives those who sacrifice to him.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_RAUM','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 40th spirit, an Earl as a crow then a man, 30 legions; steals treasure from kings'' houses, destroys cities and dignities, tells things past and future, reconciles friends and foes.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_FOCALOR','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 41st spirit, a Duke as a winged man, 30 legions; drowns men and overturns warships, having power over wind and sea, hoping to return to the Seventh Throne after 1,000 years.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VEPAR','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 42nd spirit, a Duke as a mermaid, 29 legions; governs the waters and guides warships, raises storms, and can kill men in three days by putrefying their wounds with worms.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SABNOCK','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 43rd spirit, a Marquis as an armed lion-headed soldier on a pale horse, 50 legions; builds towers and castles full of weapons, afflicts men with putrefying wounds, gives good familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SHAX','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 44th spirit, a Marquis as a stock-dove, 30 legions; takes away sight, hearing and understanding, steals money and horses, reveals hidden things, but deceives unless bound in a triangle.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VINE','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 45th spirit, a King and Earl as a lion on a black horse bearing a viper, 36 legions; reveals hidden things and witches, tells past and future, builds towers, casts down walls, stirs storms.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BIFRONS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 46th spirit, an Earl, 26 legions; teaches astrology, geometry and the arts and the virtues of herbs and stones, and moves bodies from grave to grave lighting seeming candles upon them.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VUAL','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 47th spirit, a Duke as a dromedary then a man speaking Egyptian, 37 legions; procures the love of women, reconciles friends and foes, tells things past, present and future.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_HAAGENTI','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 48th spirit, a President as a winged bull then a man, 33 legions; makes men wise in all things, transmutes metals into gold, and changes wine into water and water into wine.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_CROCELL','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 49th spirit, a Duke, 48 legions; teaches geometry and the liberal sciences, discourses of hidden things, and warms waters producing the appearance of baths.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_FURCAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 50th spirit, a Knight, 20 legions; teaches philosophy, astronomy, rhetoric, logic, chiromancy and pyromancy.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BALAM','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 51st spirit, a terrible King, 40 legions; answers truly of things past, present and to come, gives invisibility and makes men witty.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ALLOCES','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 52nd spirit, a Duke, 36 legions; teaches astronomy and the liberal sciences and bestows good and faithful familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_CAIM','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 53rd spirit, a President, 30 legions; gives understanding of the voices of birds, oxen, dogs and the sound of waters, and answers truly of things to come.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_MURMUR','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 54th spirit, a Duke and Earl, 30 legions; teaches philosophy and constrains the souls of the deceased to appear and answer questions.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_OROBAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 55th spirit, a Prince, 20 legions; answers truly of past/present/future and of divinity and creation, gives dignities and favour, and is faithful, not suffering the conjurer to be tempted by any spirit.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_GREMORY','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 56th spirit, a Duke, 26 legions; tells of things past/present/future and of hidden treasures, and procures the love of women young and old.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_OSE','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 57th spirit, a President, 30 legions; makes one cunning in the liberal sciences, gives true answers of secret things, and can transform a man into any shape or drive him to madness.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_AMY','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 58th spirit, a President, 36 legions; teaches astrology and the liberal sciences, gives good familiars, and reveals treasures kept by spirits.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ORIAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 59th spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; teaches the virtues of the stars and the mansions of the planets, gives dignities and the favour of friends and foes, and transforms men.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VAPULA','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 60th spirit, a Duke, 36 legions; makes men knowing in handicrafts, professions, philosophy and other sciences.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ZAGAN','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 61st spirit, a King and President, 33 legions; makes men witty, turns wine to water and water to wine, blood to wine and metal to coin, and makes fools wise.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VOLAC','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 62nd spirit, a President (Ualac/Valak), 38 legions; gives true answers of hidden treasures and reveals where serpents may be found, delivering them harmless to the magician.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ANDRAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 63rd spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; sows discord and will slay the master, servants and assistants if the conjurer is not wary.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_HAURES','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 64th spirit, a Duke (Flauros), 36 legions; answers truly of past/present/future, of divinity and the fall of spirits, destroys the conjurer''s enemies by fire and guards against other spirits.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ANDREALPHUS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 65th spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; teaches geometry, measurement and astronomy, makes men subtle in reasoning, and can transform a man into the likeness of a bird.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_CIMEJES','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 66th spirit, a Marquis (Kimaris), 20 legions; rules the spirits of Africa, teaches grammar, logic and rhetoric, discovers lost or hidden things and buried treasure, and makes excellent warriors.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_AMDUSIAS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 67th spirit, a Duke (Amdukias), 29 legions; causes unseen trumpets and musical instruments to be heard and bends trees at the conjurer''s will, giving excellent familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BELIAL','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 68th spirit, a mighty King created next after Lucifer, 80 legions; distributes preferments and dignities, gives the favour of friends and foes, and requires offerings to answer truly. The Goetic reception of the biblical/Second-Temple Belial.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_DECARABIA','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 69th spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; discovers the virtues of birds and precious stones and makes the likeness of birds fly before the conjurer as familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SEERE','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 70th spirit, a Prince under Amaymon, 26 legions; good-natured, goes and returns in the twinkling of an eye, brings abundance, discovers thefts and hidden treasure.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_DANTALION','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 71st spirit, a Duke, 36 legions; teaches all arts and sciences, declares the secret counsel of any person, reads and changes thoughts, and causes love, showing the likeness of any person.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ANDROMALIUS','SRC_LEMEGETON','The 72nd and last spirit, an Earl, 36 legions; brings back thieves and stolen goods, discovers wickedness and underhand dealing, punishes thieves, and reveals hidden treasures.','primary text attestation');
INSERT INTO entity_sources (entity_id,source_id,evidence_type,source_note)
INSERT INTO _p VALUES
 ('ENT_GOE_ARS_GOETIA','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 72 demons catalogued in Johann Weyer''s Pseudomonarchia Daemonum (1577) and the Ars Goetia of the Lesser Key of Solomon (Lemegeton, 17th c.), ranked as kings, dukes, princes, marquises, presidents, earls and knights, each commanding legions of spirits.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_INFERNAL_HIERARCHY','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The organizing rank-structure of Hell''s princes and officers systematized in the early-modern demonological treatises (Weyer 1577; Michaelis 1613; Collin de Plancy, Dictionnaire Infernal 1818) — the court standing above the 72 spirits of the Ars Goetia.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SEVEN_DEADLY_DEMONS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','Peter Binsfeld''s 1589 pairing of each cardinal sin with a presiding demon: Lucifer=pride, Mammon=greed, Asmodeus=lust, Leviathan=envy, Beelzebub=gluttony, Satan=wrath, Belphegor=sloth.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BELPHEGOR','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The deadly-sin demon of SLOTH (Binsfeld 1589); in de Plancy a prince who tempts men with ingenious inventions and the promise of ease and riches. Derived from the Moabite/Midianite Baal-Peor (Numbers 25).'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ADRAMELECH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','Great Chancellor of Hell and President of the High Council of Devils, superintendent of the demon-king''s wardrobe (de Plancy). Originally a deity of Sepharvaim to whom children were burned (2 Kings 17:31).'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 1st spirit, a King ruling in the East commanding 66 legions; appears with three heads (toad, man, cat) and makes the conjurer invisible.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_AGARES','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 2nd spirit, a Duke of the East riding a crocodile, 31 legions; teaches all languages, brings back runaways, causes earthquakes.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VASSAGO','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 3rd spirit, a good-natured Prince, 26 legions; declares things past and to come and discovers what is hidden or lost.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SAMIGINA','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 4th spirit, a Marquis as a small horse or ass, 30 legions; teaches the liberal sciences and gives account of the souls of those who died in sin.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_MARBAS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 5th spirit, a President as a great lion, 36 legions; answers of hidden things, causes and cures diseases, teaches mechanical arts, and changes men into other shapes.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VALEFOR','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 6th spirit, a Duke as a lion with an ass''s head, 10 legions; a good familiar who tempts those he serves toward thievery.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_AMON','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 7th spirit, a Marquis as a wolf with a serpent''s tail (or raven-headed man), 40 legions; tells things past and to come, procures love, reconciles enemies. Name possibly echoes Egyptian Amun or Baal-Hammon (debated).'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BARBATOS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 8th spirit, a Duke, 30 legions; gives understanding of the voices of animals, discovers treasures hidden by enchantment, tells things past and to come.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_PAIMON','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 9th spirit, a great King obedient to Lucifer riding a camel, 200 legions; teaches all arts, sciences and secret things and binds men to the conjurer''s will.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BUER','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 10th spirit, a President (wheel-form, Sagittarius), 50 legions; teaches philosophy, logic and the virtues of herbs, and heals all distempers.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_GUSION','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 11th spirit, a Duke (baboon-like), 40 legions; answers things past, present and to come, reconciles friends, gives honour and dignity.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SITRI','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 12th spirit, a Prince with leopard''s head and griffin''s wings, 60 legions; inflames men and women with love and causes them to reveal themselves wantonly.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BELETH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 13th spirit, a terrible King riding a pale horse with trumpets sounding before him, 85 legions; procures the love of any man or woman.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_LERAJE','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 14th spirit, a Marquis in green clad as an archer, 30 legions; causes great battles and contests and makes arrow-wounds putrefy.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ELIGOS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 15th spirit, a Duke as a goodly knight with lance and serpent, 60 legions; discovers hidden things, knows things to come and of wars, procures the favour of lords and knights.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ZEPAR','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 16th spirit, a Duke in red apparel and armour, 26 legions; makes women love men and brings them together, and can make women barren.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BOTIS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 17th spirit, a President and Earl (viper then man with sword), 60 legions; tells things past and to come and reconciles friends and foes.'),
