 ('ENT_GOE_ALLOCES','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 52nd spirit, a Duke, 36 legions; teaches astronomy and the liberal sciences and bestows good and faithful familiars.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_CAIM','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 53rd spirit, a President, 30 legions; gives understanding of the voices of birds, oxen, dogs and the sound of waters, and answers truly of things to come.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_MURMUR','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 54th spirit, a Duke and Earl, 30 legions; teaches philosophy and constrains the souls of the deceased to appear and answer questions.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_OROBAS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 55th spirit, a Prince, 20 legions; answers truly of past/present/future and of divinity and creation, gives dignities and favour, and is faithful, not suffering the conjurer to be tempted by any spirit.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_GREMORY','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 56th spirit, a Duke, 26 legions; tells of things past/present/future and of hidden treasures, and procures the love of women young and old.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_OSE','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 57th spirit, a President, 30 legions; makes one cunning in the liberal sciences, gives true answers of secret things, and can transform a man into any shape or drive him to madness.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_AMY','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 58th spirit, a President, 36 legions; teaches astrology and the liberal sciences, gives good familiars, and reveals treasures kept by spirits.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ORIAS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 59th spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; teaches the virtues of the stars and the mansions of the planets, gives dignities and the favour of friends and foes, and transforms men.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VAPULA','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 60th spirit, a Duke, 36 legions; makes men knowing in handicrafts, professions, philosophy and other sciences.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ZAGAN','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 61st spirit, a King and President, 33 legions; makes men witty, turns wine to water and water to wine, blood to wine and metal to coin, and makes fools wise.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_VOLAC','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 62nd spirit, a President (Ualac/Valak), 38 legions; gives true answers of hidden treasures and reveals where serpents may be found, delivering them harmless to the magician.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ANDRAS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 63rd spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; sows discord and will slay the master, servants and assistants if the conjurer is not wary.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_HAURES','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 64th spirit, a Duke (Flauros), 36 legions; answers truly of past/present/future, of divinity and the fall of spirits, destroys the conjurer''s enemies by fire and guards against other spirits.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ANDREALPHUS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 65th spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; teaches geometry, measurement and astronomy, makes men subtle in reasoning, and can transform a man into the likeness of a bird.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_CIMEJES','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 66th spirit, a Marquis (Kimaris), 20 legions; rules the spirits of Africa, teaches grammar, logic and rhetoric, discovers lost or hidden things and buried treasure, and makes excellent warriors.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_AMDUSIAS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 67th spirit, a Duke (Amdukias), 29 legions; causes unseen trumpets and musical instruments to be heard and bends trees at the conjurer''s will, giving excellent familiars.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_BELIAL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 68th spirit, a mighty King created next after Lucifer, 80 legions; distributes preferments and dignities, gives the favour of friends and foes, and requires offerings to answer truly. The Goetic reception of the biblical/Second-Temple Belial.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_DECARABIA','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 69th spirit, a Marquis, 30 legions; discovers the virtues of birds and precious stones and makes the likeness of birds fly before the conjurer as familiars.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_SEERE','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 70th spirit, a Prince under Amaymon, 26 legions; good-natured, goes and returns in the twinkling of an eye, brings abundance, discovers thefts and hidden treasure.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_DANTALION','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 71st spirit, a Duke, 36 legions; teaches all arts and sciences, declares the secret counsel of any person, reads and changes thoughts, and causes love, showing the likeness of any person.'),
 ('ENT_GOE_ANDROMALIUS','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 72nd and last spirit, an Earl, 36 legions; brings back thieves and stolen goods, discovers wickedness and underhand dealing, punishes thieves, and reveals hidden treasures.');
