 ('ENT_CHR_BEELZEBUL','member_of','ENT_GOE_INFERNAL_HIERARCHY','medium','Beelzebub is a chief prince of Hell in Weyer and de Plancy.','SRC_DEPLANCY_INFERNAL'),
